/* Deutsch Trainer — Kursbuch C1 (lv 6).
   10 Einheiten + 2 Stationen in studio-d style: Einstieg, Hören, Lesen,
   Dialog, Übungen, Sprechen, Schreiben, Aussprache, Wortschatz.
   At C1 the learner is no longer learning to be correct. The work is
   precision, register and argumentative architecture: how a claim is
   hedged, who is made responsible by a nominalisation, where a text
   concedes in order to turn, and which connector carries which
   commitment. Every Lesetext is a real written register and every
   Hörtext is an argument in motion.                                   */
